Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 22:38:53 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 05/12] AOSCOS: Integrate Plasma shell windows with the X11
 window manager

Set X11 window types, panel struts, shadows and edge triggers for native
X11. Keep the normal Wayland shell and its layer surfaces.

